Name: CarrierFix (RootHide)
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Experimental Cricket/AT&T carrier overlay diagnostic and SMS/IMS repair tool for jailbroken iOS 15-17. Verifies a per-carrier backup and restore preflight before modifying the active overlay.
